:c_025785fd a skos:Concept;
  skos:definition "A dating method superseding potassium-argon dating by allowing age determination from a single analysis. This is achieved by converting a controlled amount of the radioactive potassium isotope to a not naturally occurring argon isotope by neutron irradiation. "@en;
